# LabInstructions/ holds raw teaching source material — lecture decks, prior-term
# lab handouts, rubrics, supplementary PDFs, spreadsheets, large media files and
# student submissions. None of it belongs in the published book repository.
#
# Ignore everything in this folder (and any sub-folder) except this file itself,
# so the ignore rule stays version-controlled while the contents never get
# committed.
*
!.gitignore
